OL,3,GNEWSASeveral injured after bus hits
OL,4,Abuilding in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been injured after
OL,7,Fa double decker bus crashed into a
OL,8,Fbuilding in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said it happened near
OL,11,Fthe junction of Union Road, Market
OL,12,FStreet and St Mary's Road, in New
OL,13,FMills, at about 17:20 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FA cordon was placed around the scene
OL,16,Fdue to concerns over a "potential gas
OL,17,Fleak", while a number of people were
OL,18,Fbeing treated for injuries. The
OL,19,Finjuries are not thought to be
OL,20,Flife-threatening, police said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
