OL,3,GNEWSASeveral injured after bus hits
OL,4,Abuilding in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad closures in Union Road, Market
OL,7,FStreet and St Mary's Road are expected
OL,8,Fto remain in place for some time, and
OL,9,Fpedestrians and motorists have been
OL,10,Fadvised to avoid the area until further
OL,11,Fnotice, the force added.
